#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""pi-delegate: hand noisy work to the local model and print a short summary.

  pi-delegate run [--timeout S] -- COMMAND...   run COMMAND, summarize its log
  pi-delegate ask [--timeout S] [--session] "TASK"
                                                let the local model investigate
  pi-delegate reset                             drop this project's ask session

Only the summary goes to stdout; diagnostics go to stderr.  Exit codes: 0 a
summary was printed, 2 usage error, 3 the local model is unavailable (Pi
missing, llama-server down, timeout).  In `run' mode the STATUS line carries
the outcome of COMMAND, the exit code only that of the delegate.

See README.md next to the real path of this script.
"""

